1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,051
[MICHAEL] Rockford Hills terrace — pouring scotch upon my throne

2
00:00:13,101 --> 00:00:15,573
[MICHAEL] You wake up in a dress, wearing dirt like cologne

3
00:00:15,623 --> 00:00:18,132
[MICHAEL] Vinewood producer — got the mansion and the gated lane

4
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,675
[MICHAEL] Your whole "enterprise" is Ron and Wade and cheap propane

5
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:23,382
[MICHAEL] Stomping out Johnny won't disguise the truth you can't destroy

6
00:00:23,432 --> 00:00:26,035
[MICHAEL] One word from Mommy leaves you fetal like a broken boy

7
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,480
[MICHAEL] Every score went sideways 'cause you couldn't hold your gun

8
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:31,900
[MICHAEL] Smart men cut a deal to live — mad dogs die on the run

9
00:00:46,786 --> 00:00:49,357
[TREVOR] "Witness protection"?! For WHAT?! Nobody took the stand!

10
00:00:49,377 --> 00:00:52,170
[TREVOR] You're Davey's crooked F.I.B. rat paying on demand!

11
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:54,531
[TREVOR] Paying off your shrink to hear you whine about your life

12
00:00:54,564 --> 00:00:57,018
[TREVOR] While Fabien and the tennis coach are stretching out your wife!

13
00:00:57,053 --> 00:00:59,521
[TREVOR] Jimmy spiked your drink and dumped his daddy in the street

14
00:00:59,561 --> 00:01:02,243
[TREVOR] Tracey's grinding Lazlow's leg on prime-time cable heat!

15
00:01:02,283 --> 00:01:05,161
[TREVOR] Yeah, I'm filthy and unhinged — wear my chaos on my chest

16
00:01:05,185 --> 00:01:07,829
[TREVOR] You're a silk-suit parasite and your own blood hates you best!

17
00:01:18,450 --> 00:01:20,828
[MICHAEL] Dragged us back to Ludendorff to dig inside the snow?

18
00:01:20,878 --> 00:01:23,740
[MICHAEL] Stare into that open grave — here's everything to know

19
00:01:23,775 --> 00:01:26,069
[MICHAEL] Brad caught the bullet that was meant to put you down

20
00:01:26,106 --> 00:01:28,580
[MICHAEL] Leaving you still breathing was my worst mistake in town

21
00:01:28,609 --> 00:01:31,049
[MICHAEL] Kidnapped Madrazo's wife just to beg for someone's care

22
00:01:31,089 --> 00:01:33,521
[MICHAEL] When Franklin lights that gasoline, nobody says a prayer

23
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:36,301
[MICHAEL] Rockstar scrapped your "Agent Trevor" — left your files to rot

24
00:01:36,337 --> 00:01:39,522
[MICHAEL] While I came back to Vinewood Hills and closed the final plot

25
00:02:01,944 --> 00:02:05,087
[TREVOR] Nine years I mourned your ghost with your name inked in my skin!

26
00:02:05,110 --> 00:02:07,645
[TREVOR] While you forged dead Brad's letters sipping poolside gin!

27
00:02:07,675 --> 00:02:10,331
[TREVOR] When Franklin called to kill you, I refused to take the shot!

28
00:02:10,366 --> 00:02:13,053
[TREVOR] You brought a gun to burn me — that's the crooked soul you've got!

29
00:02:13,096 --> 00:02:15,315
[TREVOR] Drop you off that tower while your family cheers below

30
00:02:15,365 --> 00:02:18,096
[TREVOR] Two fake graves for Townley — now lay permanently low!

31
00:02:18,146 --> 00:02:20,885
[TREVOR] Two-thirty million sold — next week Vice City takes the throne

32
00:02:20,935 --> 00:02:23,950
[TREVOR] Keep your mansion, Judas — die a traitor, die alone!
